  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵歡迎來到提示詞工程的迷人世界，在這裡，AI 驅動的圖像創作力量推動著創造力的邊界。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "今天，我們將深入探討 Microsoft 的 Image Creator 如何以各種藝術風格將你的圖像創作帶入生活。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我不是藝術專家，但透過研究圖像生成學到了很多關於藝術風格的知識。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這是定義整體圖像風格的提示詞的第一部分。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "生成的圖像可能無法完全代表藝術風格；它只是生成的參考。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我不是藝術專家，以下類別僅基於我的個人偏好。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提示詞：Time-worn and weathered Prehistoric Cave Painting Of A Llama",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "僅使用史前洞穴繪畫無法生成清晰的圖像。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "添加像 time-worn 和 weathered 這樣的關鍵字可以大大改善圖像。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提示詞：Warli Art Simplicity Of Tribal Art.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "a lone llama in an oasis inside a wild desert.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Warli 藝術風格展示了部落藝術的簡約和優雅，從古代人類的視角呈現平面、二維的圖案。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提示詞：Arabesque style.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
