        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "阿拉伯式起源於中東。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "該風格生成使用幾何圖案、流暢曲線和抽象形狀的結構，創造出優雅和奢華的感覺。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提示詞：Baroque style.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "a llama in an oasis",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "巴洛克風格的特點是宏偉和華麗的特徵，如流暢的曲線、複雜的雕刻和戲劇性的照明，創造出戲劇性、奢華和情感強度的感覺。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
