      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提示詞：Gothic art style.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-1",
        "title": "提示詞工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第一部分",
